{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729580/extras/83cae451531a40fe87c61e6cbd50976a.apng?t=1768209928\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729580/extras/83cae451531a40fe87c61e6cbd50976a.poster.avif?t=1768209928\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=37 /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729580/extras/2283944f05daaf35f219a882758c3ea9.webp?t=1768209928\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729580/extras/2283944f05daaf35f219a882758c3ea9.poster.avif?t=1768209928\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world full of spirit monsters that have been corrupted living in nothing but despair awaits for a noble hero to shine its internal light within to save the world for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through this top-down action-adventure game as you collect &amp; solve puzzles in order for you to explore &amp; unravel this mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features: </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore A Mysterious World...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect your way through this mysterious world in order to proceed.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encountering Overworld puzzles as you progress through the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing through minigames to interact with the spirit monsters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean a Spirit Village from being corrupted!!!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get to pat &amp; hug spirit monsters!!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... You can clean a roast beef...???</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfil your true purpose ...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1729580?t=1768209928","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768209928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768209928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729580/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768209928","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains bright flashing imagery, Unsettling sounds & a scene containing mild gore. Viewer discretion is advised. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729580/extras/83cae451531a40fe87c61e6cbd50976a.apng?t=1768209928\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729580/extras/83cae451531a40fe87c61e6cbd50976a.poster.avif?t=1768209928\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=37 /></picture></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729580/extras/2283944f05daaf35f219a882758c3ea9.webp?t=1768209928\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729580/extras/2283944f05daaf35f219a882758c3ea9.poster.avif?t=1768209928\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A worl